{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Calc Plus 是一款介面簡潔的現代計算機，適合需要快速完成日常運算、貨幣與單位換算，以及同時處理多組算式的人士使用。無論是即時查看答案，還是把不同計算分開整理，都可以在同一個 App 內完成，不必在多個工具之間來回切換。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>邊輸入邊顯示即時結果</h2>\n<p>Calc Plus 主打邊輸入邊顯示答案，無須每次按等號即可看到結果，日常計算更順手。內置貨幣與單位換算功能，可直接在 App 內切換數值，省去另開其他工具的時間。支援多個計算分頁，方便同時處理不同算式並隨時切換，配合計算歷史記錄，日後翻查舊有算式更輕鬆。另提供多款主題、按鍵樣式與替代 App 圖示，讓用家自行配搭介面風格。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-20-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-21-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-22-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-23-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-24-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Calc Plus – Calculator</li>\n<li>應用類別：Utilities</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-11T22:58:02.239399+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":365,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-11T22:53:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-13T04:18:10.638772+00:00","content_updated_at":null,"content_hash":"a13f8cb70f3f2bb7ea1f6623150d4b23aabaf7c3ff65afc89bcfb5eeace4a802","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}